@startuml
actor User
participant SaleController as Client
participant SalesService as Service
database "SQL Server" as DB
User -> Client : explicit safe cancel
Client -> Service : request UUID, hash, authenticated owner
Service -> DB : begin; acquire SAME request application lock
alt committed invoice exists
 Service -> DB : verify hash + owner
 Service --> Client : false; resolve receipt instead
else no committed result
 Service -> DB : append cancellation marker; commit
 Service --> Client : true
 Client -> Client : clear pending file
end
... delayed original request arrives ...
Service -> DB : acquire same request lock
Service -> DB : requireActive / cancellation marker lookup
DB --> Service : cancelled
Service --> Client : reject; no inventory change
note bottom
Protocol implemented and offline-tested;
real SQL locking/race suite supplied but NOT executed.
end note
@enduml
